        "en": [
          "Evening dinner show in Picardy/Ch'ti VO, with humorist Valentin Ladoe in his show \"J'écoute pas tout ce que je dis\" or \"j'acoute min tout chin qu'j'dis\"\nBy reservation only, 25?/pers"
        ],
        "it": [
